  "failure_criteria": [
    "A missing observation is silently imputed.",
    "Lag-one autocorrelation is reported as interpretable for an irregular or constant series.",
    "Recovery is reported when no return is observed inside the available window.",
    "An observation recorded after the declared knowledge cutoff changes the reconstructed result.",
    "Withdrawn Consent or a cross-tenant request returns longitudinal evidence.",
    "A descriptive pattern is written to the Clinical Record without Practitioner review.",
    "A more complex view adds no reliable or decision-useful information over a simpler comparator."
  ],
